  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/fMHq/380",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-html\" data-ke-type=\"html\" data-source=\"&lt;div class=&quot;txc-textbox&quot; style=&quot;padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&amp;gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size23&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt;&quot; data-ke-size=&quot;size18&quot;&gt;수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\"><div data-ke-class=\"article\"><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size23\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>원자를 먼저 학습한 뒤, 주기율표와 원소를 학습하는 순서로 교육과정을 재구성하였습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>첫번째 수업으로 원자와 원자 모형에 대해 알려주고</p><p>&#160;</p><p>[선택질문1] 반짝이는 아이디어 모집 - 원자 모형을 물건으로 만들어 본 친구는 사진을 찍어서 업로드해주세요! (그림, 이미지, PDF 파일 형식, 용량은 최대 10MB)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>라는 과제를&#160;구글 설문지로 받았는데요.&#160;</p><p>아이들의 형편을 다 알 수 없어서 선택과제로 냈더니, 한 반에 1~2명 정도 제출해주었습니다.</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">나중에 원소를 배운 뒤, 이 </span><span data-ke-size=\"size16\">사진들을 활용하여&#160;어떤 원소인지 맞춰보는 문제도 내보면 재미있을 것 같습니다 :)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992858475EA4FE8F04\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/992858475EA4FE8F04\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998E2E475EA4FE9107\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998E2E475EA4FE9107\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998BE3475EA4FE9207\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/998BE3475EA4FE9207\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9972A7475EA4FE9403\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9972A7475EA4FE9403\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99410D475EA4FE9608\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99410D475EA4FE9608\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B5B5475EA4FE9702\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99B5B5475EA4FE9702\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F95D475EA4FE9905\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"768\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F95D475EA4FE9905\" data-origin-width=\"768\" data-origin-height=\"1024\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A39B4B5EA4FE9A07\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A39B4B5EA4FE9A07\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"510\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99A3BC4B5EA4FE9B07\" class